  "identifier": "fastsurfer",
  "name": "FastSurfer",
  "description": "Deep learning neuroimaging pipeline for fast and accurate whole-brain MRI analysis. Performs whole-brain segmentation of 95+ cortical and subcortical structures in ~5 minutes (GPU) and produces FreeSurfer-compatible surface reconstructions, cortical thickness maps, and volumetric measures from T1-weighted MRI. Runs 10-15x faster than FreeSurfer with comparable accuracy. Includes specialised sub-modules for cerebellum (CerebNet), hypothalamus (HypVINN), corpus callosum, and lesion inpainting. Apache 2.0, 602 stars, v2.4.2 (February 2025). Developed by Deep-MI Lab at the German Center for Neurodegenerative Diseases (DZNE), Helmholtz.",
  "url": "https://github.com/Deep-MI/FastSurfer",
