  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference open-source alternative to FreeSurfer for brain MRI segmentation — Apache 2.0, 602 stars, v2.4.2 (February 2025), 10-15x faster than FreeSurfer with comparable accuracy. Peer-reviewed in NeuroImage 2020, actively extended with sub-modules for cerebellum, hypothalamus, and corpus callosum. Produces FreeSurfer-compatible outputs, making it a drop-in replacement for existing workflows. Essential for any team running large-scale neuroimaging cohort studies, dementia research, or clinical MRI volumetry where FreeSurfer's processing time is a bottleneck.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
